<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland, Liechtenstein and the Spanish territories of Ceuta and Melilla to five Ecus per tonne from a previous level of four Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU also raised the refund on rye exports to the same destinations to 22.00 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 21.50 Ecus.</p>
<p>The EU's grain panel cut the refund on barley exports to these destinations to 18.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 19.00 Ecus.</p>
</text>
